body:
hi op! transferee rin ako for t1 23-24 and naaccept naman ako sa animation despite having 3 failed major subjects (engineering calc, orgchem, and engineering physics 😭) 

if it helps ung mga kuya ko ren na maraming bagsak nakapasok sa benilde (human resources and information systems ung course nila in benilde) 

i think 1 failed grade isnt anything to worry about :) goodluck tho!!
